{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124080","id":5670831152,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGMxTog","number":124080,"title":"Consolidate Jolt decorator shapes into one and make it a leaf shape","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-01T23:58:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T15:01:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T14:42:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124080","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124080.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124080.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-02T14:42:15Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123754\r\n- Supersedes #123828\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis looks messy at first glance, but the actual functional change here is fairly small.\r\n\r\nBasically, because `JoltCustomDoubleSidedShape` currently overrides `JPH::Shape::CollectTransformedShapes` to defer to its inner shape, it won't itself be treated as a \"leaf shape\", which the current implementation of `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D::intersect_shape` needs it to be if we want it to actually respect any \"double-sidedness\".\r\n\r\nHowever, just omitting the override of `JPH::Shape::CollectTransformedShapes` won't do, because we also use `JoltCustomDoubleSidedShape` for entire objects (areas specifically), and turning entire objects into \"leaf shapes\" would break things.\r\n\r\nTo address this we could make it so that `JoltCustomDoubleSidedShape` only ever wraps individual shapes rather than entire objects/areas, but this is mildly wasteful, as we'd be allocating another per-instance decorator shape for every shape on every area.\r\n\r\nSo instead we exploit the fact that we already have a per-instance decorator shape, namely `JoltCustomUserDataShape`, meaning we can co-opt it to also host any \"double-sidedness\" that the object and/or shape might have. I've decided to call this new amalgamation `JoltCustomInstanceOverridesShape`, as in the place where per-instance overrides (user data and back-face collision for now) lives.\r\n\r\nThis ends up with a net negative amount of code, because we get rid of not only `JoltCustomDoubleSidedShape`, but also `JoltCustomDecoratedShape` that I'd used as the base class for decorator shapes, which doesn't make much sense to keep around with only one class to derive from it.\r\n\r\nIt also ends up having side effects on unrelated code:\r\n\r\n1. The `SetSimCollideBodyVsBody` callback in `JoltSpace3D` no longer has to worry about the \"double-sidedness\" being stripped away, since `JoltCustomInstanceOverridesShape` is a leaf shape.\r\n2. `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D::get_closest_point_to_object_volume` (as used by audio) now _does_ have to manually unwrap `JoltCustomInstanceOverridesShape` in order to check if the shape is convex or not.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124080/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}